divergence_reason = sanctioned: this program uses Std.Db kernels (Db.open / Db.withTransaction / Db.exec / Db.unsafeFindWhere / Db.getString / Db.getInt) — the Go backend emits Go+SQLite (cgo) binaries while ipê emits Rust+sqlx; the SQLite in-memory connection-pool behaviour and row-type representation differ enough that a shared Main.sky cannot run on both backends. ipê's output is the correct reference. The parameterised-args channel (List String bound via ? placeholders) is exercised here — callers are NOT interpolating values into the WHERE clause.
